# 💬 OPIc Expressions - Day 07

## Expression

One of my favorite things is...

Meaning

제가 가장 좋아하는 것 중 하나는...

---

## Examples

One of my favorite things is studying English.

One of my favorite things is listening to music.

One of my favorite things is learning about AI and semiconductors.

---

## Useful Alternatives

- What I enjoy most is...
- I really enjoy...
- My favorite thing is...
